                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "238511381",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198234516860",
                            "num_reviews": 568,
                            "playtime_forever": 163,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 163,
                            "last_played": 1792899228
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An ok puzzle adventure game. Given the price and the content, I recommend waiting for a really good special.\n\n- Took me about 2.5hrs to finish including all achievements.\n- The puzzles were very easy, which makes this a good game for those looking to relax with minimal challenge. Although the difficulty may be suitable for older children, the story may be too scary for them.\n- The plot was a little loose, but it was alright overall.\n- There were a few written mistakes and one or two moments where the written dialogue didn't match the spoken dialogue, but they didn't really impact my enjoyment of the game.\n- There were also one or two items which had the wrong name- eg. a keepsake box which said you needed to find a key for it, but actually you needed a small crank handle.",
